      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ひっひっひ！　オマエたちは、血の海を渡り\n死者の山を越え、冥府を覗いたみたいだね！\nでも、真の地獄を見るのはこれからさ。\nなにせ、ボクが隣にいるんだからね？",
        "official_en": "Heh HEH! So, you've crossed a sea of blood,\ntraversed mountains of the dead, peeked into the\nunderworld...but now the real hell begins, because\nyou've got me around.",
